WEBVTT

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:13.780
This is the film crew 
from <i>Discovery! Creatures Galore.</i>

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.160
They're here to take a look around 
for the filming tomorrow.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.830
They wanted to say "hi" to the staff.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:23.360
Senpai!

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.150
It's been such a long time!

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.260
Ruka-chan!

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:02.390
Thanks for getting in touch with me.

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:06.520
I was surprised when I heard 
you were coming to Tingarla for a show.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.360
I was so happy!

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.020
It's not <i>that</i> big of a deal.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.040
You could have contacted me, too.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:15.260
That's so cold of you, 
only contacting Ruka.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.490
Sorry.

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:19.660
You're an attendant now, huh, Fuuka-chan?

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.240
I work with Cape penguins.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.990
We'll be in your care tomorrow, then.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:27.080
You're getting footage 
of the hatchling, right?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.280
You're documenting their
 introduction to the pool.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.590
We heard they haven't been in the pool yet.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.470
We were thinking about focusing 
on the name reveal,

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.800
but that would be a bit boring by itself.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:45.010
It's up to the hatchling 
whether it goes into the pool, though.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:47.610
It's a documentary, after all.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:50.280
They can't swim? 
Even though it's a penguin?

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:51.900
They're a bit timid.

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:54.570
They're each quite different.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:59.110
Say, would it be all right 
if we could get you on, too?

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:00.910
On what?

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.050
On the show, of course.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:06.040
I think if we can get 
a working attendant on the show,

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:09.930
it'll draw that much more attention 
to the animals.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.830
That's fantastic!

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:16.120
We wouldn't mind, 
if it's all right with Tingarla.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:18.940
But I'm not going on TV anymore.

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:21.980
Could you take it up with PR first?

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.380
Miyazawa has some work to do, too.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.120
That's true.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.520
If you need a reporter, 
I'm the chief, so—

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.770
Don't worry about it!

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.790
We gotta help each other out.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.110
Right, Chiyu-san?

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.020
Y-Yeah.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:38.150
Crap.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.610
Fuuka-chan, we're begging you!

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:47.790
They're so cute!

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.260
This is the penguin for tomorrow, huh?

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.290
That's right.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:53.720
There, there.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.160
Good penguin.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.430
They ran away.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.020
They really are timid, huh?

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:03.090
This might be tough.

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:05.120
They have their new plumage already.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:07.350
They should be ready to swim any day now.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:10.590
I wonder if they're afraid of the pool.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:12.890
They've been hiding in the nest 
this whole time.

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:14.890
You gotta be strong.

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:17.560
Or you're never going 
to make it in life.

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:26.480
Plankton.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:27.160
Yes, sir!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:31.290
You're supposed to be meeting with the staff 
about the opening of the new area.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:36.120
If I can just have a moment. I'll be back
as soon as I get a look at the filming.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.990
Filming? For TV?

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.710
It's been on my mind since I heard 
the Yona Productions people were here.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:45.130
Don't tell me you want 
to see an idol.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.360
N-No way!

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:49.720
I saw her earlier.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.110
Ruka-chan was so cute!

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:54.540
I swear it's nothing like that!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:55.980
I'm just worried about Fuuka.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.150
Worry about your own work first.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:02.320
I'm responsible for the project, 
but you're the one in charge of it.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:05.580
The person in charge can't
be sitting on her ass.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:06.520
Okay.

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:09.280
Also, tidy up your desk.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:15.420
I think I saw Miyazawa-san 
with the TV crew.

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:18.890
I wonder if she's going to be on TV?

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.460
I'm going to the bathroom!

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.290
Hey, Plankton!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.340
Oh, no.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.350
Kukuru.

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:41.940
This is the largest tank at Tingarla.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:45.070
It takes inspiration from
the Kuroshio region near Okinawa.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.140
It's home to roughly 
two thousand swimming animals,

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:50.320
including sand tiger sharks, manta rays,

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:56.660
yellowfin tuna, giant grouper, 
whitetip reef shark, and other large fish.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:58.970
Fuuka.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.340
Kukuru?

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:07.470
What's wrong?

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.740
Are you all right?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:12.280
You're here with the Yona Productions people, 
aren't you?

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.310
Are you okay with it?

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.920
I'm fine.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:19.220
They wanted me to be a reporter, 
but I'm going to turn them down.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.150
Really?

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:25.690
If I wanted to go back to being an idol, 
I would've taken that movie gig.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:26.780
But...

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.240
Jeez. You worry too much, Kukuru.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:34.560
To be honest, 
I'm uneasy about being on TV.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:39.640
People are going to see me and wonder 
what I'm doing, not being an idol anymore.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:42.900
Never mind me...

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.210
Fuuka?

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.140
Sorry!

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:53.360
Thanks for being concerned about me.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:55.400
Let's do some good work.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:56.100
Yeah.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:06:59.870
Pass.

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:03.470
Sorry, but it's already set in stone 
that you're going to be on TV.

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:05.210
The director asked for you.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:05.940
Huh?

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:08.280
Because you're one of the handsome ones.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:11.530
I mean... If they needed
someone handsome, you're...

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.030
I'm what?

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.660
Kukuru said there'd be a reward 
for appearing.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:20.320
It's Grams's plum wine again, isn't it?

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:22.460
She can't keep pulling that on me.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.460
I wonder if Miyazawa-san's all right, though.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.910
They had to be from Yona Productions, 
of all places...

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:29.320
Dunno.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.580
I'm sure she's fine.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.850
I'm sure you understand.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.350
We're counting on you tomorrow.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.690
You need to have some focus 
in your career.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.060
Okay.

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:50.430
Let's take advantage 
of this opportunity.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:51.420
Okay.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.580
I have to work harder.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.170
For Senpai's sake, too.

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:05.960
Work hard.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.380
For my sake, too.

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:16.430
Thank you for inviting me out.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:20.160
It's been a while, so I wanted
some quality time to catch up.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:22.520
At least, that was my hope.

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:25.900
Nothing beats a drink after work!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.270
Grams's plum wine is the best!

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:31.280
Oh man, it's actually Ruka-chan.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.110
Sorry!

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:37.870
I thought it'd be more fun with more
people here, so I called everyone.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.640
You all work with my senpai, right?

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:42.620
I'm happy to meet you.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.240
Thank goodness.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.790
Wait, where's Kukuru?

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:46.730
Overtime.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.050
She seems especially busy lately.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:51.340
You sure know a lot.

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:53.300
We work together.

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:56.380
How was Fuuka-chan as a senior?

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.880
She was kind.

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:00.930
She'd join me when I was staying late 
to train and stuff.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.600
I just wanted to train, too.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.040
You're right. She's kind.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:10.770
Sometimes she'd hang around for my sake 
and then end up going home even later than me.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:13.280
Being an idol is like 
being in a sports anime, huh?

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.760
She's still just as hard-working, huh?

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:17.660
Yup, yup.

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.590
Everyone's working hard, 
including Fuuka-chan!

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:22.480
I love you all!

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.950
I love you, plum wine!

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.240
Are you all right?

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:43.540
You seemed a bit down.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:49.550
I get bummed when I think about the fact 
that I still haven't quite made it.

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:52.610
I love working as an idol, though.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:53.450
Yeah.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:58.710
I'm really glad I get to be on TV 
with you again, though, Senpai.

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:03.450
I'm thinking of turning them down.

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:06.460
Why would you do that?

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.340
I don't really feel like being on TV.

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:14.590
I loved working as an idol, too.

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.970
But the penguins are more important 
to me now.

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:25.210
As an attendant, your job is 
to believe in animals and be there for them.

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:28.850
Sometimes, you have to give them a push.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.240
But that seems to suit me.

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:32.580
It's really fun.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.180
Are you really...

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:38.360
Are you really giving up 
on a career as an idol?

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:40.710
Ruka-chan?

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.440
Senpai...

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.870
You worked so hard until now.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.190
And yet...

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.100
Yet, I—!

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:49.980
Ruka-chan.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:00.600
It's pretty, isn't it?

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.810
You can see a lot of stars here 
that you can't in Tokyo.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.860
Thank you for everything today.

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.150
See you tomorrow!

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:18.440
Good night.

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.050
We should get going, too.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.870
What should we do about Kuuya-san?

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.420
Kai-kun, can you let him crash 
at your place, please?

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:30.960
I knew it.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:34.500
I hope this is a good change 
of pace for Ruka-chan.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.970
She's having a hard time right now.

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:41.680
Some of her fans are harassing her online.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.500
They're saying management favors
her too much for how talented she is.

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:47.850
I never knew.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:52.520
You could be working your butt off, 
but we fans would never see it.

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:07.030
<b>Goodbye, High Heels</b>

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.040
<b>Closed</b>

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.040
<b>We'll be back in a bit.</b>

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.040
<b>Hours: 9 AM to 9 PM</b>

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:13.770
I'll be in your care today.

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:15.540
Thanks, Fuuka-chan.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.670
I'm so glad you'll be on the show.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.670
I'm feeling encouraged.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.760
Let's nail it.

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:24.180
Okay!

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:27.160
Ready...

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.560
Action!

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:34.650
Hello! I'm <i>Discovery! 
Creatures Galore</i> correspondent, Shiroi Ruka.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:40.280
I'm here in Okinawa at Aquarium Tingarla, 
which opened just this spring.

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:44.030
And we have a special guest 
with us today.

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:48.660
Former member of Yona Productions, 
now an attendant at Aquarium Tingarla,

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:51.100
Miyazawa Fuuka-san!

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:52.270
Hello.

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.100
Welcome to Tingarla.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:59.170
Ruka-chan and I are going to try our best
today to convey how awesome it is here.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:01.760
Wow!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.420
Look at all those fish!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:08.000
There are over 1,800 animals in this tank.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:09.160
Really?

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.890
Wow.

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:15.800
I'm scared!

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.500
Help!

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:24.810
Let's learn from the splitfin flashlightfish 
and communicate with light together.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.730
Fuuka-senpai!

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:33.910
Hey, look.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.000
They're cute.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:40.560
The spotted eagle ray swims
gracefully in the water.

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:45.010
But they are very cautious, 
and they were very difficult to tame.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.010
Let's eat!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:51.140
The view and the food are fantastic!

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:56.600
<b>Stable</b>

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:56.600
<b>Tare</b>

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:56.600
<b>Zero</b>

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:58.100
3,215 grams.

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.010
They seem to be in good health.

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.820
I think they're ready for their appearance.

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:05.420
I'm disappointed, though.

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:06.360
About what?

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.810
I wanted to be on TV!

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:11.910
You might show up a bit 
while you're working.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:13.310
Really?

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.410
I'm going to record it 
and show my family.

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:18.420
Hopefully they get into the pool, too.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:20.420
You can do it!

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.640
<i>Tú puedes!</i>

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:26.170
Damn it! They got me.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:29.180
You downed all that plum wine.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:33.150
Why do I need to be 
in front of the camera?

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:34.480
Director's orders.

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:36.190
You don't have a choice.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:39.520
Maybe I should have showed off 
some brackish species.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.500
Why don't you take that off already?

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.360
I gathered the guest surveys.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.820
Take a look later.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:46.780
Thanks.

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:49.450
Don't you want to go see the filming?

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:51.080
I do!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:52.270
But...

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:53.740
No time, huh?

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:59.410
I wonder if Miyazawa-san's all right 
with being on TV.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.240
She said she'd turn them down yesterday.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:04.330
Then...

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.330
I think she'll be okay, though.

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:10.170
I'm sure she has a plan of some sort.

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:14.350
Well then, everyone, 
allow me to introduce...

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:17.970
This is the cute penguin baby!

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:28.650
And now, announcing the name 
of the penguin...

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.860
<b>The name of the penguin baby is</b>

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.860
<b>Shiratama-chan</b>

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.860
Shiratama!

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.970
We surveyed our guests for a name.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:41.370
We had over a thousand suggestions.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.420
That many?

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.920
All the attendants got together to choose.

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:47.280
It was a close battle 
until the very end.

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:49.300
Names are important, after all.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:53.040
And your name is marvelous, too.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:55.980
Shiro iruka, as in, "white dolphin"!

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:56.640
Huh?

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:58.890
"White dolphin"?

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:00.730
Oh, I see!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:04.980
I'm the white dolphin 
of the idol world, Shiroi Ruka!

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:08.230
Squee, squee!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.990
J-Just kidding.

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:22.150
You've got good taste, 
playing along with my puns.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:36.260
Feels nice, huh?

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.980
I come here sometimes during my breaks.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.270
Sorry to make you worry.

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:45.460
I've had so many outtakes since then.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:49.070
Everyone loses momentum sometimes.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.060
I keep messing up.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:56.160
I get too into it and ruin it.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.620
Like, I go off on my own.

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:01.980
I gotta do better.

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:11.450
I decided to appear 
because you were there, Ruka-chan.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:12.870
Here.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.180
They're so pretty.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:27.450
My dream was to stand on stage 
in these shoes.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:28.700
I worked so hard.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.960
But I couldn't bring myself 
to throw them out, even after I quit.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.580
So I put them away.

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:34.860
Why not?

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:38.870
I thought they would give
me encouragement as an attendant.

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:42.340
But I'm beyond that now.

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:46.700
So if it's all right with you, I want
you to keep them as a good-luck charm.

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:51.020
They might give you strength, too.

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:53.460
But aren't they important to you?

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:57.020
You don't need to work hard for my sake.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:59.840
Work hard for Shiroi Ruka's sake.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:01.620
Senpai...

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.150
Let's work hard on the rest of the shoot.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:12.090
Yeah!

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:34.130
Will Shiratama-chan finally
 make it into the pool?

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.780
Oh, dear.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.780
Maybe that was a bit scary.

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:02.890
Don't do that.

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:04.450
You're scaring them.

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:18.570
You can do it.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.330
They started preening.

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:37.400
Come on! Jump in, please!

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:38.760
Oh, no...

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:39.900
This isn't good.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.370
Shall we wait for a bit?

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.210
Are they going to be all right?

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:58.910
They'll be all right.

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:00.520
We have to believe in them.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.930
That they can overcome
their fears on their own.

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.450
Off you go.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.560
Thank goodness.

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:48.930
Fuuka really did become an attendant, huh?

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:50.480
Yeah.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:53.020
All of us in the penguin team 
are proud of her.

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:00.150
She's so amazing.

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:16.250
Shiratama-chan has made their pool debut!

00:22:49.200 --> 00:22:54.220
I thought they can't live 
outside cold climates.

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:59.440
Some penguins are like that,
but the penguins at Tingarla are Cape penguins.

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:01.770
They don't even need air conditioning!

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:05.780
She has her detractors,

00:23:06.340 --> 00:23:10.910
but she also has a lot of fans 
who say her enthusiasm gives them strength.

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:12.330
I see.

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:16.320
Shiratama, I'm so happy for you.

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:18.080
Did you sneak out of work again?

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:19.440
Fuuka!

00:23:19.440 --> 00:23:21.080
Good job!

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:22.940
Don't tell the assistant director.

00:23:23.320 --> 00:23:25.310
How was the filming?

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:26.800
It was surprisingly fun.

00:23:28.080 --> 00:23:30.300
You weren't an idol for nothing!

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:35.100
I think I love this job.
